# Container-required development

Read `AGENTS.md` and `PROJECT.md` before substantive work, then follow
`docs/validation.md` for the affected area.

Before the first application-tooling operation in each substantive session,
run `cl-workbench doctor --strict` from the repository root. If it fails, stop
and report the failure; never use a host interpreter/compiler or a portable
fallback. A task limited to reading or editing files is exempt. The exact
scope, rerun conditions, and container entry points are defined in
`docs/validation.md`.
